ecution:Reconnaissance &amp; Scanning: Used Nmap for passive asset mapping and service fingerprinting.Packet Analysis: Tracked communication layers using Wireshark to locate system vulnerabilities.Exploitation Sequence: Used Metasploit Framework vectors to achieve root authorization footprints.Black Box Hacking Lab Screen📂 Download PresentationProject 2: Enterprise Hybrid Lab &amp; Splunk SIEM EngineeringDesigned a multi-site network lab within EVE-NG to evaluate zero-trust network layout boundaries. Simulated live Red Team penetration routing paths over an encrypted IPsec VPN tunnel while aggregating enterprise telemetry back to a central Splunk platform.Core Phases Execution:Network Isolation: Programmed pfSense firewalls to contain lateral host movement.Offensive Auditing: Ran custom vulnerability sequences against target systems and corporate web elements.Detection Engineering: Engineered specialized Splunk Processing Language (SPL) rules to trigger immediate alerts on live attacks.EVE-NG Network Topology Map💻 View Splunk Configurations📩 Connect With MeLooking for a dedicated Security Analyst? Let's talk!Email: kofiagyei79@gmail.comGitHub Profile© 2026 Kofi Agyei Portfolio. Built with HTML5 &amp; CSS3. ,project one is able to open but project two is not able</h2><div jsuid="MnlGHc_98" aria-hidden="false" style="" data-animation-skip="" data-ved="2ahUKEwiE4ueE7M2WAxUnEmIAHe7iEZ4Q_sYPeggIAggBCB4QAA"><div jsuid="MnlGHc_9l" class="xEFZqe" jsaction="mouseenter:&amp;MnlGHc_8l|ZUljYd;focusin:&amp;MnlGHc_8l|aXD3Gb;focusout:&amp;MnlGHc_8l|Mrjwi"><!--qkimaf MnlGHc_8l/WyzG9e--><div class="SK38Xc" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;MnlGHc_a2|npT2md" jscontroller="Zdw5w#ZIKyQ" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="MnlGHc_a2" data-wiz-uids="MnlGHc_a4" data-sfc-inited="2"><div class="qeawje" jsaction="action:&amp;MnlGHc_a2|ZUljYd" data-ved="2ahUKEwiE4ueE7M2WAxUnEmIAHe7iEZ4QhvMSeggIAggBCB4QAQ"><div jsuid="MnlGHc_ac" class="YHsVn" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="mouseenter:&amp;MnlGHc_ac|ZUljYd;mouseleave:&amp;