e-60b4f00cde06" aria-label="Related results" class="vDOt8c" jsaction="click:&amp;MnlGHc_1d4|CXhG2e;mouseenter:&amp;MnlGHc_1d4|wndyDd;mouseleave:&amp;MnlGHc_1d4|yrMC6" data-ved="2ahUKEwiE4ueE7M2WAxUnEmIAHe7iEZ4Qye0OeggIAggBCHwQAQ" data-hveid="CAIIAQh8EAE" data-processed="true"><span class="pxxQye T6UJT" data-processed="true"><div class="a14YJe" jsaction="" jscontroller="sRLmTc#WhfBh" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="MnlGHc_1da" data-processed="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" height="12px" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="12px"><path d="M440-280H280q-83 0-141.5-58.5T80-480q0-83 58.5-141.5T280-680h160v80H280q-50 0-85 35t-35 85q0 50 35 85t85 35h160v80ZM320-440v-80h320v80H320Zm200 160v-80h160q50 0 85-35t35-85q0-50-35-85t-85-35H520v-80h160q83 0 141.5 58.5T880-480q0 83-58.5 141.5T680-280H520Z"></path></svg><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div></span><div jsuid="MnlGHc_1d5" style="display: none;" data-ved="2ahUKEwiE4ueE7M2WAxUnEmIAHe7iEZ4QlZkReggIAggBCHwQAg" data-processed="true"></div></button></span><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;07560383-5541-4c68-bcee-60b4f00cde06&quot;,null,null,0,&quot;&quot;,&quot;&quot;,0,null,null,null,null,0,null,0]]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><ul class="KsbFXc U6u95" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="mPWODf#NS0kde" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="MnlGHc_1dw" data-ved="2ahUKEwiE4ueE7M2WAxUnEmIAHe7iEZ4Q-7AUeggIAggBCH4QAA" data-hveid="CAIIAQh-EAA" data-processed="true"><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="MnlGHc_1e0" data-hveid="CAIIAQh-EAE" data-processed="true"><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="MnlGHc_1e1" data-processed="true"><strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="MnlGHc_1e2" data-processed="true">Case Sensitivity:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Linux servers (like GitHub Pages or Netlify) treat <code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="MnlGHc_1e5" data-processed="true">Topology.png<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code> and <code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="MnlGHc_1e7" data-processed="true">topology.png<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code> as entirely different files.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="MnlGHc_1ea" data-hveid="CAIIAQh-EAI" data-processed="true"><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="MnlGHc_1ec" data-processed="true"><strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="MnlGHc_1ed" data-processed="true">Relative Paths:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Do not use absolute desktop paths like <code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="MnlGHc_1eh" data-processed="true">C:/Users/Kofi/Documents/portfolio/image.png<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code>. Use relative paths like <code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="MnlGHc_1ei" data-processed="true">images/image.png<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="MnlGHc_1ej" data-hveid="CAIIAQh-EAM" data-processed="true"><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="MnlGHc_1em" data-processed="true"><strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="MnlGHc_1eq" data-processed="true">Missing Files:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Ensure you actually committed and pushed the new assets to your GitHub repository.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><span jsuid="MnlGHc_1er" class="DHPVt Wg1cdb notranslate" jsaction="rc