        &lt;</span><span class="mexSqb" data-processed="true">div</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true"> class=</span><span class="CS0cqb" data-processed="true">"project-card"</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true">&gt;
            &lt;</span><span class="mexSqb" data-processed="true">h3</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true">&gt;Project </span><span class="tnfcCf" data-processed="true">1</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true">: Black Box Hacking Simulation (Capstone)&lt;/</span><span class="mexSqb" data-processed="true">h3</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true">&gt;
            &lt;</span><span class="mexSqb" data-processed="true">p</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true">&gt;Simulated a real-world defensive audit on a blind target environment. Researched hidden attack surfaces, ran stealth service tracking controls, exploited security gaps safely, and structured executive documentation briefs.&lt;/</span><span class="mexSqb" data-processed="true">p</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true">&gt;
            
            &lt;</span><span class="mexSqb" data-processed="true">h4</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true">&gt;Core Phases Execution:&lt;/</span><span class="mexSqb" data-processed="true">h4</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true">&gt;
            &lt;</span><span class="mexSqb" data-processed="true">ul</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true">&gt;
                &lt;</span><span class="mexSqb" data-processed="true">li</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true">&gt;&lt;</span><span class="mexSqb" data-processed="true">strong</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true">&gt;Reconnaissance &amp; Scanning:&lt;/</span><span class="mexSqb" data-processed="true">strong</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true">&gt; Used Nmap for passive asset mapping and service fingerprinting.&lt;/</span><span class="mexSqb" data-processed="true">li</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true">&gt;
                &lt;</span><span class="mexSqb" data-processed="true">li</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true">&gt;&lt;</span><span class="mexSqb" data-processed="true">strong</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true">&gt;Packet Analysis:&lt;/</span><span class="mexSqb" data-processed="true">strong</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true">&gt; Tracked communication layers using Wireshark to locate system vulnerabilities.&lt;/</span><span class="mexSqb" data-processed="true">li</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true">&gt;
                &lt;</span><span class="mexSqb" data-processed="true">li</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true">&gt;&lt;</span><span class="mexSqb" data-processed="true">strong</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true">&gt;Exploitation Sequence:&lt;/</span><span class="mexSqb" data-processed="true">strong</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true">&gt; Used Metasploit Framework vectors to achieve root authorization footprints.&lt;/</span><span class="mexSqb" data-processed="true">li</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true">&gt;
            &lt;/</span><span class="mexSqb" data-processed="true">ul</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true">&gt;
            
            </span><span class="ClTQqc" data-processed="true">&lt;!-- FIX: Uses your real repository image name --&gt;</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true">
            &lt;</span><span class="mexSqb" data-processed="true">img</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true"> class=</span><span class="CS0cqb" data-processed="true">"project-image"</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true"> src=</span><span class="CS0cqb" data-processed="true">"image_d9a34027.png"</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true"> alt=</span><span class="CS0cqb" data-processed="true">"Black Box Hacking Lab Screen"</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true">&gt;
            &lt;</span><span class="mexSqb" data-processed="true">a</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true"> href=</span><span class="CS0cqb" data-processed="true">"./Presentation1Black%20Box%20system%20testing.pptx"</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true"> class=</span><span class="CS0cqb" data-processed="true">"btn"</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true">&gt;📂 Download Presentation&lt;/</span><span class="mexSqb" data-processed="true">a</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true">&gt;
