            &lt;</span><span class="mexSqb" data-processed="true">p</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true">&gt;Designed a multi-site network lab within EVE-NG to evaluate zero-trust network layout boundaries. Simulated live Red Team penetration routing paths over an encrypted IPsec VPN tunnel while aggregating enterprise telemetry back to a central Splunk platform.&lt;/</span><span class="mexSqb" data-processed="true">p</span><span class="undefined" data-processed="true">&gt;
            
