know</div></div><div jsuid="MnlGHc_1uy" style="display: none" class="XpWxo"><div class="VT1SYd"><div class="QRnEfb">Google may use account and system data to understand your feedback and improve our services, subject to our <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" class="c0nryc"><span class="sds-typography-utility__colorOnSurfaceLink" style="">Privacy Policy</span></a> and <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" class="c0nryc"><span class="sds-typography-utility__colorOnSurfaceLink">Terms of Service</span></a>. For legal issues, <a href="https://support.google.com/legal/answer/3110420" target="_blank" class="c0nryc"><span class="sds-typography-utility__colorOnSurfaceLink">make a legal removal request</span></a>.</div></div></div>\x3c!--TgQPHd|||[114,{&quot;u&quot;:0},false,false]--></div>');</script><div class="CKgc1d" data-scope-id="turn" jsname="CS7uPe" jsmodel="p9hQFe CPTaDd LUQCCe wuVnCd KgpZcc pRMv2d" jsaction="" jscontroller="uUCgYd#gXWog" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="MnlGHc_2" data-processed="true" style="--rhs-column-margin-top: -170px;"><div jsuid="MnlGHc_w" style="display: contents" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;MnlGHc_w|npT2md" jscontroller="TB3Kme#Vp2Xub" data-sfc-root="ep" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--qkimaf MnlGHc_w/HugV6--><div jsuid="MnlGHc_y" class="ilZyRc R7mRQb" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;MnlGHc_y|npT2md" jscontroller="Qv2YAd#WGLFCb" data-sfc-root="ep" data-wiz-uids="MnlGHc_1j,MnlGHc_1k,MnlGHc_1l,MnlGHc_1m,MnlGHc_1n,MnlGHc_1q,MnlGHc_1s,MnlGHc_1u,MnlGHc_1v" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><h2 class="iMqumd" data-processed="true">You sent: 1 tab and said: 77 78 79 80 81 82 83 84 85 86 87 88 89 90 91 92 93 94 95 96 97 98 99100101102103104105106107108109110111112113114115116117118119120121122123124125126127128129130131132133134135136137138139140141142143144145146147148149150151152153154155156157158159160161162163164&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt; .btn:hover { background-color: #30363d; border-color: #8b949e; } footer { text-align: center; padding: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); font-size: 0.9rem; } &lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body&gt; &lt;header&gt; &lt;h1&gt;Kofi Agyei&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;p&gt;Cybersecurity Analyst &amp; Systems Security Engineer&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/header&gt; &lt;div class="container"&gt; &lt;!-- Skills Section --&gt; &lt;section&gt; &lt;h2&gt;🛠️ Technical Security Skills &amp; Tools&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;ul class="skills-list"&gt; &lt;li&gt;🟢 Network Scanning: &lt;strong&gt;Nmap&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;🟢 Exploitation: &lt;strong&gt;Metasploit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;🟢 Traffic Analysis: &lt;strong&gt;Wireshark&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;🟢 SIEM &amp; Analytics: &lt;strong&gt;Splunk&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;🟢 Boundary Routing: &lt;strong&gt;pfSense / VPN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;🟢 Testing: &lt;strong&gt;Black Box Testing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/section&gt; &lt;hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); margin: 3rem 0;"&gt; &lt;!-- Projects Section --&gt; &lt;h2&gt;🚀 Cyber Range Portfolio Projects&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;!-- Project 1 --&gt; &lt;div class="project-card"&gt; &lt;h3&gt;Project 1: Black Box Hacking Simulation (Capstone)&lt;/h3&gt; &lt;p&gt;Simulated a real-world defensive audit on a blind target environment. Researched hidden attack surfaces, ran stealth service tracking controls, exploited security gaps safely, and structured executive documentation briefs.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h4&gt;Core Phases Execution:&lt;/h4&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reconnaissance &amp; Scanning:&lt;/strong&gt; Used Nmap for passive asset mapping and service fingerprinting.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Packet Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Tracked communication layers using Wireshark to locate system vulnerabilities.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exploitation Sequence:&lt;/strong&gt; Used Metasploit Framework vectors to achieve root authorization footprints.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;img class="project-image" src="black-box-hacking.png" alt="Black Box Hacking Lab Screen"&gt; &lt;a href="./Presentation1Black%20Box%20system%20testing.pptx" class="btn"&gt;📂 Download Presentation&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;!-- Project 2 --&gt; &lt;div class="project-card"&gt; &lt;h3&gt;Project 2: Enterprise Hybrid Lab &amp; Splunk SIEM Engineering&lt;/h3&gt; &lt;p&gt;Designed a multi-site network lab within EVE-NG to evaluate zero-trust network layout boundaries. Simulated live Red Team penetration routing paths over an encrypted IPsec VPN tunnel while aggregating enterprise telemetry back to a central Splunk platform.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h4&gt;Core Phases Execution:&lt;/h4&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Network Isolation:&lt;/strong&gt; Programmed pfSense firewalls to contain lateral host movement.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Offensive Auditing:&lt;/strong&gt; Ran custom vulnerability sequences against target systems and corporate web elements.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detection Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineered specialized Splunk Processing Language (SPL) rules to trigger immediate alerts on live attacks.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;img class="project-image" src="network-topology.png" alt="EVE-NG Network Topology Map"&gt; &lt;a href="./defensive-blue-team/splunk/" class="btn"&gt;💻 View Splunk Configurations&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;!-- Contact Section --&gt; &lt;section style="text-align: center; margin-top: 4rem;"&gt; &lt;h2&gt;📩 Connect With Me&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;Looking for a dedicated Security Analyst? Let's talk!&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Email:&lt;/strong&gt; kofiagyei79@gmail.com&lt;/p&gt; &lt;a href="https://github.com" class="btn"&gt;GitHub Profile&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/section&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;footer&gt; &amp;copy; 2026 Kofi Agyei Portfolio. Built with HTML5 &amp; CSS3. &lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;Use Control + Shift + m to toggle the tab key moving focus. Alternatively, use esc then tab to move to the next interactive element on the page.</h2><div jsuid="MnlGHc_1j" aria-hidden="false" style="" data-animation-skip="" data-ved="2ahUKEwiE4ueE7M2WAxUnEmIAHe7iEZ4Q_sYPeggIAggBCBUQAA" data-processed="true"><div jsuid="MnlGHc_1v" class="xEFZqe" jsaction="mouseenter:&amp;MnlGHc_y|ZUljYd;focusin:&amp;MnlGHc_y|aXD3Gb;focusout:&amp;MnlGHc_y|Mrjwi" data-processed="true"><!--qkimaf MnlGHc_y/WyzG9e--><div class="SK38Xc" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;MnlGHc_2x|npT2md" jscontroller="Zdw5w#ZIKyQ" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="MnlGHc_2x" data-wiz-uids="MnlGHc_2z" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><div class="qeawje" jsaction="action:&amp;MnlGHc_2x|ZUljYd" data-ved="2ahUKEwiE4ueE7M2WAxUnEmIAHe7iEZ4QhvMSeggIAggBCBUQAQ" data-processed="true"><div jsuid="MnlGHc_32" class="YHsVn" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="mouseenter:&amp;MnlGHc_32|ZUljYd;mouseleave:&amp;MnlGHc_32|aXD3Gb;focusin:&amp;MnlGHc_32|Mrjwi;focusout:&amp;MnlGHc_32|CXhG2e;" jscontroller="nqTR2b#MCVA2" data-sfc-root="ep" data-wiz-uids="MnlGHc_35,MnlGHc_37,MnlGHc_39" data-ved="2ahUKEwiE4ueE7M2WAxUnEmIAHe7iEZ4QkK0UeggIAggBCBUQAg" data-processed="true"><div jsuid="MnlGHc_3b" class="YHsVn" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="mouseenter:&amp;MnlGHc_3b|ZUljYd;mouseleave:&amp;MnlGHc_3b|aXD3Gb;focusin:&amp;MnlGHc_3b|Mrjwi;focusout:&amp;MnlGHc_3b|CXhG2e;" jscontroller="nqTR2b#MCVA2" data-sfc-root="ep" data-wiz-uids="MnlGHc_3c,MnlGHc_3e,MnlGHc_3g" data-ved="2ahUKEwiE4ueE7M2WAxUnEmIAHe7iEZ4QkK0UeggIAggBCBUQAw" data-processed="true"><div jsuid="MnlGHc_3j" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="cXTEid#e0nEwf" data-sfc-root="ep" data-ved="2ahUKEwiE4ueE7M2WAxUnEmIAHe7iEZ4Qh9gSeggIAggBCBUQBA" data-processed="true"><button jsuid="MnlGHc_3q" class="FTsWP RmjGdc IsqrXb FInYGf" id="" aria-label="Copy 77 78 79 80 81 82 83 84 85 86 87 88 89 90 91 92 93 94 95 96 97 98 991001011021031041051061071081091101111121131141151161171181191201211221231241251261271281291301311321331341351361371381391401411421431441451461471481491501511521531541551561571581591601611621631