list&quot;&gt; &lt;li&gt;🟢 Network Scanning: &lt;strong&gt;Nmap&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;🟢 Exploitation: &lt;strong&gt;Metasploit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;🟢 Traffic Analysis: &lt;strong&gt;Wireshark&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;🟢 SIEM &amp; Analytics: &lt;strong&gt;Splunk&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;🟢 Boundary Routing: &lt;strong&gt;pfSense / VPN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;🟢 Testing: &lt;strong&gt;Black Box Testing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/section&gt; &lt;hr style=&quot;border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); margin: 3rem 0;&quot;&gt; &lt;!-- Projects Section --&gt; &lt;h2&gt;🚀 Cyber Range Portfolio Projects&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;!-- Project 1 --&gt; &lt;div class=&quot;project-card&quot;&gt; &lt;h3&gt;Project 1: Black Box Hacking Simulation (Capstone)&lt;/h3&gt; &lt;p&gt;Simulated a real-world defensive audit on a blind target environment. Researched hidden attack surfaces, ran stealth service tracking controls, exploited security gaps safely, and structured executive documentation briefs.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h4&gt;Core Phases Execution:&lt;/h4&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reconnaissance &amp; Scanning:&lt;/strong&gt; Used Nmap for passive asset mapping and service fingerprinting.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Packet Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Tracked communication layers using Wireshark to locate system vulnerabilities.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exploitation Sequence:&lt;/strong&gt; Used Metasploit Framework vectors to achieve root authorization footprints.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;project-image&quot; src=&quot;black-box-hacking.png&quot; alt=&quot;Black Box Hacking Lab Screen&quot;&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;./Presentation1Black%20Box%20system%20testing.pptx&quot; class=&quot;btn&quot;&gt;📂 Download Presentation&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;!-- Project 2 --&gt; &lt;div class=&quot;project-card&quot;&gt; &lt;h3&gt;Project 2: Enterprise Hybrid Lab &amp; Splunk SIEM Engineering&lt;/h3&gt; &lt;p&gt;Designed a multi-site network lab within EVE-NG to evaluate zero-trust network layout boundaries. Simulated live Red Team penetration routing paths over an encrypted IPsec VPN tunnel while aggregating enterprise telemetry back to a central Splunk platform.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h4&gt;Core Phases Execution:&lt;/h4&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Network Isolation:&lt;/strong&gt; Programmed pfSense firewalls to contain lateral host movement.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Offensive Auditing:&lt;/strong&gt; Ran custom vulnerability sequences against target systems and corporate web elements.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detection Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineered specialized Splunk Processing Language (SPL) rules to trigger immediate alerts on live attacks.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;project-image&quot; src=&quot;network-topology.png&quot; alt=&quot;EVE-NG Network Topology Map&quot;&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;./defensive-blue-team/splunk/&quot; class=&quot;btn&quot;&gt;💻 View Splunk Configurations&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;!-- Contact Section --&gt; &lt;section style=&quot;text-align: center; margin-top: 4rem;&quot;&gt; &lt;h2&gt;📩 Connect With Me&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;Looking for a dedicated Security Analyst? Let&#39;s talk!&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Email:&lt;/strong&gt; kofiagyei79@gmail.com&lt;/p&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com&quot; class=&quot;btn&quot;&gt;GitHub Profile&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/section&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;footer&gt; &amp;copy; 2026 Kofi Agyei Portfolio. Built with HTML5 &amp; CSS3. &lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;Use Control + Shift + m to toggle the tab key moving focus. Alternatively, use esc then tab to move to the next interactive element on the page." data-tooltip-classes="undefined" data-is-tooltip-wrapper="undefined" data-tooltip-id="undefined" aria-describedby="" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="pointerdown:&amp;MnlGHc_5q|FEiYhc;pointerup:&amp;MnlGHc_5q|mF5Elf;pointerenter:&amp;Mn