lor: #8b949e; } footer { text-align: center; padding: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); font-size: 0.9rem; } &lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body&gt; &lt;header&gt; &lt;h1&gt;Kofi Agyei&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;p&gt;Cybersecurity Analyst &amp; Systems Security Engineer&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/header&gt; &lt;div class="container"&gt; &lt;!-- Skills Section --&gt; &lt;section&gt; &lt;h2&gt;🛠️ Technical Security Skills &amp; Tools&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;ul class="skills-list"&gt; &lt;li&gt;🟢 Network Scanning: &lt;strong&gt;Nmap&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;🟢 Exploitation: &lt;strong&gt;Metasploit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;🟢 Traffic Analysis: &lt;strong&gt;Wireshark&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;🟢 SIEM &amp; Analytics: &lt;strong&gt;Splunk&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;🟢 Boundary Routing: &lt;strong&gt;pfSense / VPN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;🟢 Testing: &lt;strong&gt;Black Box Testing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/section&gt; &lt;hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); margin: 3rem 0;"&gt; &lt;!-- Projects Section --&gt; &lt;h2&gt;🚀 Cyber Range Portfolio Projects&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;!-- Project 1 --&gt; &lt;div class="project-card"&gt; &lt;h3&gt;Project 1: Black Box Hacking Simulation (Capstone)&lt;/h3&gt; &lt;p&gt;Simulated a real-world defensive audit on a blind target environment. Researched hidden attack surfaces, ran stealth service tracking controls, exploited security gaps safely, and structured executive documentation briefs.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h4&gt;Core Phases Execution:&lt;/h4&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reconnaissance &amp; Scanning:&lt;/strong&gt; Used Nmap for passive asset mapping and service fingerprinting.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Packet Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Tracked communication layers using Wireshark to locate system vulnerabilities.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exploitation Sequence:&lt;/strong&gt; Used Metasploit Framework vectors to achieve root authorization footprints.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;img class="project-image" src="black-box-hacking.png" alt="Black Box Hacking Lab Screen"&gt; &lt;a href="./Presentation1Black%20Box%20system%20testing.pptx" class="btn"&gt;📂 Download Presentation&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;!-- Project 2 --&gt; &lt;div class="project-card"&gt; &lt;h3&gt;Project 2: Enterprise Hybrid Lab &amp; Splunk SIEM Engineering&lt;/h3&gt; &lt;p&gt;Designed a multi-site network lab within EVE-NG to evaluate zero-trust network layout boundaries. Simulated live Red Team penetration routing paths over an encrypted IPsec VPN tunnel while aggregating enterprise telemetry back to a central Splunk platform.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h4&gt;Core Phases Execution:&lt;/h4&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Network Isolation:&lt;/strong&gt; Programmed pfSense firewalls to contain lateral host movement.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Offensive Auditing:&lt;/strong&gt; Ran custom vulnerability sequences against target systems and corporate web elements.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detection Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineered specialized Splunk Processing Language (SPL) rules to trigger immediate alerts on live attacks.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;img class="project-image" src="network-topology.png" alt="EVE-NG Network Topology Map"&gt; &lt;a href="./defensive-blue-team/splunk/" class="btn"&gt;💻 View Splunk Configurations&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;!-- Contact Section --&gt; &lt;section style="text-align: center; margin-top: 4rem;"&gt; &lt;h2&gt;📩 Connect With Me&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;Looking for a dedicated Security Analyst? Let's talk!&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Email:&lt;/strong&gt; kofiagyei79@gmail.com&lt;/p&gt; &lt;a href="https://github.com" class="btn"&gt;GitHub Profile&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/section&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;footer&gt; &amp;copy; 2026 Kofi Agyei Portfolio. Built with HTML5 &amp; CSS3. &lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;Use Control + Shift + m to toggle the tab key moving focus. Alternatively, use esc t