ong&gt;Splunk&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;🟢 Boundary Routing: &lt;strong&gt;pfSense / VPN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;🟢 Testing: &lt;strong&gt;Black Box Testing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/section&gt; &lt;hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); margin: 3rem 0;"&gt; &lt;!-- Projects Section --&gt; &lt;h2&gt;🚀 Cyber Range Portfolio Projects&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;!-- Project 1 --&gt; &lt;div class="project-card"&gt; &lt;h3&gt;Project 1: Black Box Hacking Simulation (Capstone)&lt;/h3&gt; &lt;p&gt;Simulated a real-world defensive audit on a blind target environment. Researched hidden attack surfaces, ran stealth service tracking controls, exploited security gaps safely, and structured executive documentation briefs.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h4&gt;Core Phases Execution:&lt;/h4&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reconnaissance &amp; Scanning:&lt;/strong&gt; Used Nmap for passive asset mapping and service fingerprinting.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Packet Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Tracked communication layers using Wireshark to locate system vulnerabilities.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exploitation Sequence:&lt;/strong&gt; Used Metasploit Framework vectors to achieve root authorization footprints.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;img class="project-image" src="black-box-hacking.png" alt="Black Box Hacking Lab Screen"&gt; &lt;a href="./Presentation1Black%20Box%20system%20testing.pptx" class="btn"&gt;📂 Download Presentation&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;!-- Project 2 --&gt; &lt;div class="project-card"&gt; &lt;h3&gt;Project 2: Enterprise Hybrid Lab &amp; Splunk SIEM Engineering&lt;/h3&gt; &lt;p&gt;Designed a multi-site network lab within EVE-NG to evaluate zero-trust network layout boundaries. Simulated live Red Team penetration routing paths over an encrypted IPsec VPN tunnel while aggregating enterprise telemetry back to a central Splunk platform.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h4&gt;Core Phases Execution:&lt;/h4&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Network Isolation:&lt;/strong&gt; Programmed pfSense firewalls to contain lateral host movement.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Offensive Auditing:&lt;/strong&gt; Ran custom vulnerability sequences against target systems and corporate web elements.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detection Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineered specialized Splunk Processing Language (SPL) rules to trigger immediate alerts on live attacks.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;img class="project-image" src="network-topology.png" alt="EVE-NG Network Topology Map"&gt; &lt;a href="./defensive-blue-team/splunk/" class="btn"&gt;💻 View Splunk Configurations&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;!-- Contact Section --&gt; &lt;section style="text-align: center; margin-top: 4rem;"&gt; &lt;h2&gt;📩 Connect With Me&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;Looking for a dedicated Security Analyst? Let's talk!&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Email:&lt;/strong&gt; kofiagyei79@gmail.com&lt;/p&gt; &lt;a href="https://github.com" class="btn"&gt;GitHub Profile&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/section&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;footer&gt; &amp;copy; 2026 Kofi Agyei Portfolio. Built with HTML5 &amp; CSS3. &lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;&lt;html lang="en"&gt;&lt;head&gt; &lt;meta charset="UTF-8"&gt; &lt;meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"&gt; &lt;title&gt;Kofi Agyei | Cybersecurity Portfolio&lt;/title&gt; &lt;style&gt; :root { --bg-color: #0d1117; --text-color: #c9d1d9; --accent-color: #58a6ff; --card-bg: #161b22; --border-color: #30363d; } body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: var(--bg-color); color: var(--text-color); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; padding: 0; } header { background-color: var(--card-bg); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 2rem 1rem; text-align: center; } h1 { color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; } h2, h3 { color: var(--accent-color); } .container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; p