d="true">12:38 PM</div></div><div class="dcCF7d" data-processed="true"></div></div><!--TgQPHd|MnlGHc_44/CiuJBb;MnlGHc_44/rssjMe;MnlGHc_44/TBFcKe;MnlGHc_44/ypKQA||[[&quot;\u003c!DOCTYPE html\u003e\u003chtml lang\u003d\&quot;en\&quot;\u003e\u003chead\u003e \u003cmeta charset\u003d\&quot;UTF-8\&quot;\u003e \u003cmeta name\u003d\&quot;viewport\&quot; content\u003d\&quot;width\u003ddevice-width, initial-scale\u003d1.0\&quot;\u003e \u003ctitle\u003eKofi Agyei | Cybersecurity Portfolio\u003c/title\u003e \u003cstyle\u003e :root { --bg-color: #0d1117; --text-color: #c9d1d9; --accent-color: #58a6ff; --card-bg: #161b22; --border-color: #30363d; } body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Segoe UI\&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: var(--bg-color); color: var(--text-color); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; padding: 0; } header { background-color: var(--card-bg); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 2rem 1rem; text-align: center; } h1 { color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; } h2, h3 { color: var(--accent-color); } .container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1rem; } .skills-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; padding: 0; list-style: none; } .skills-list li { background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: 6px; text-align: center; } .project-card { background-color: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 8px; padding: 2rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; } .project-image { max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); margin: 1.5rem 0; display: block; } .btn { display: inline-block; background-color: #21262d; color: var(--accent-color); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; margin-right: 0.5rem; margin-top: 0.5rem; } .btn:hover { background-color: #30363d; border-color: #8b949e; } footer { text-align: center; padding: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); font-size: 0.9rem; } \u003c/style\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e \u003cheader\u003e \u003ch1\u003eKofi Agyei\u003c/h1\u003e \u003cp\u003eCybersecurity Analyst \u0026 Systems Security Engineer\u003c/p\u003e \u003c/header\u003e \u003cdiv class\u003d\&quot;container\&quot;\u003e \u003c!-- Skills Section --\u003e \u003csection\u003e \u003ch2\u003e🛠️ Technical Security Skills \u0026 Tools\u003c/h2\u003e \u003cul class\u003d\&quot;skills-list\&quot;\u003e \u003cli\u003e🟢 Network Scanning: \u003cstrong\u003eNmap\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e🟢 Exploitation: \u003cstrong\u003eMetasploit\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e🟢 Traffic Analysis: \u003cstrong\u003eWireshark\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e🟢 SIEM \u0026 Analytics: \u003cstrong\u003eSplunk\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e🟢 Boundary Routing: \u003cstrong\u003epfSense / VPN\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e🟢 Testing: \u003cstrong\u003eBlack Box Testing\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e \u003c/ul\u003e \u003c/section\u003e \u003chr style\u003d\&quot;border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); margin: 3rem 0;\&quot;\u003e \u003c!-- Projects Section --\u003e \u003ch2\u003e🚀 Cyber Range Portfolio Projects\u003c/h2\u003e \u003c!-- Project 1 --\u003e \u003cdiv class\u003d\&quot;project-card\&quot;\u003e \u003ch3\u003eProject 1: Black Box Hacking Simulation (Capstone)\u003c/h3\u003e \u003cp\u003eSimulated a real-world defensive audit on a blind target environment. Researched hidden attack surfaces, ran stealth service tracking controls, exploited security gaps safely, and structured executive documentation briefs.\u003c/p\u003e \u003ch4\u003eCore Phases Execution:\u003c/h4\u003e \u003cul\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReconnaissance \u0026 Scanning:\u003c/strong\u003e Used Nmap for passive asset mapping and service fingerprinting.\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePacket Analysis:\u003c/strong\u003e Tracked communication layers using Wireshark to locate system vulnerabilities.\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExploitation Sequence:\u003c/strong\u003e Used Metasploit Framework vectors to achieve root authorization footprints.\u003c/li\u003e \u003c/ul\u003e \u003cimg class\u003d\&quot;project-image\&quot; src\u003d\&quot;black-box-hacking.png\&quot; alt\u003d\&quot;Black Box Hacking Lab Screen\&quot;\u003e \u003ca href\u003d\&quot;./Presentation1Black%20Box%20system%20testing.pptx\&quot; class\u003d\&quot;btn\&quot;\u003e📂 Download Presentation\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c!-- Project 2 --\u003e \u003cdiv class\u003d\&quot;project-card\&quot;\u003e \u003ch3\u003eProject 2: Enterprise Hybrid Lab \u0026 Splunk SIEM Engineering\u003c/h3\u003e \u003cp\u003eDesigned a multi-site network lab within EVE-NG to evaluate zero-trust network layout boundaries. Simulated live Red Team penetration routing paths over an encrypted IPsec VPN tunnel while aggregating enterprise telemetry back to a central Splunk platform.\u003c/p\u003e \u003ch4\u003eCore Phases Execution:\u003c/h4\u003e \u003cul\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNetwork Isolation:\u003c/strong\u003e Programmed pfSense firewalls to contain lateral host movement.\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOffensive Auditing:\u003c/strong\u003e Ran custom vulnerability sequences against target systems and corporate web elements.\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDetection Engineering:\u003c/strong\u003e Engineered specialized Splunk Processing Language (SPL) rules to trigger immediate alerts on live attacks.\u003c/li\u003e \u003c/ul\u003e \u003cimg class\u003d\&quot;project-image\&quot; src\u003d\&quot;network-topology.png\&quot; alt\u003d\&quot;EVE-NG Network Topology Map\&quot;\u003e \u003ca href\u003d\&quot;./defensive-blue-team/splunk/\&quot; class\u003d\&quot;btn\&quot