03cli\u003e🟢 Traffic Analysis: \u003cstrong\u003eWireshark\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e🟢 SIEM \u0026 Analytics: \u003cstrong\u003eSplunk\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e🟢 Boundary Routing: \u003cstrong\u003epfSense / VPN\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e🟢 Testing: \u003cstrong\u003eBlack Box Testing\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e \u003c/ul\u003e \u003c/section\u003e \u003chr style\u003d\&quot;border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); margin: 3rem 0;\&quot;\u003e \u003c!-- Projects Section --\u003e \u003ch2\u003e🚀 Cyber Range Portfolio Projects\u003c/h2\u003e \u003c!-- Project 1 --\u003e \u003cdiv class\u003d\&quot;project-card\&quot;\u003e \u003ch3\u003eProject 1: Black Box Hacking Simulation (Capstone)\u003c/h3\u003e \u003cp\u003eSimulated a real-world defensive audit on a blind target environment. Researched hidden attack surfaces, ran stealth service tracking controls, exploited security gaps safely, and structured executive documentation briefs.\u003c/p\u003e \u003ch4\u003eCore Phases Execution:\u003c/h4\u003e \u003cul\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReconnaissance \u0026 Scanning:\u003c/strong\u003e Used Nmap for passive asset mapping and service fingerprinting.\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePacket Analysis:\u003c/strong\u003e Tracked communication layers using Wireshark to locate system vulnerabilities.\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExploitation Sequence:\u003c/strong\u003e Used Metasploit Framework vectors to achieve root authorization footprints.\u003c/li\u003e \u003c/ul\u003e \u003cimg class\u003d\&quot;project-image\&quot; src\u003d\&quot;black-box-hacking.png\&quot; alt\u003d\&quot;Black Box Hacking Lab Screen\&quot;\u003e \u003ca href\u003d\&quot;./Presentation1Black%20Box%20system%20testing.pptx\&quot; class\u003d\&quot;btn\&quot;\u003e📂 Download Presentation\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c!-- Project 2 --\u003e \u003cdiv class\u003d\&quot;project-card\&quot;\u003e \u003ch3\u003eProject 2: Enterprise Hybrid Lab \u0026 Splunk SIEM Engineering\u003c/h3\u003e \u003cp\u003eDesigned a multi-site network lab within EVE-NG to evaluate zero-trust network layout boundaries. Simulated live Red Team penetration routing paths over an encrypted IPsec VPN tunnel while aggregating enterprise telemetry back to a central Splunk platform.\u003c/p\u003e \u003ch4\u003eCore Phases Execution:\u003c/h4\u003e \u003cul\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNetwork Isolation:\u003c/strong\u003e Programmed pfSense firewalls to contain lateral host movement.\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOffensive Auditing:\u003c/strong\u003e Ran custom vulnerability sequences against target systems and corporate web elements.\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDetection Engineering:\u003c/strong\u003e Engineered specialized Splunk Processing Language (SPL) rules to trigger immediate alerts on live attacks.\u003c/li\u003e \u003c/ul\u003e \u003cimg class\u003d\&quot;project-image\&quot; src\u003d\&quot;network-topology.png\&quot; alt\u003d\&quot;EVE-NG Network Topology Map\&quot;\u003e \u003ca href\u003d\&quot;./defensive-blue-team/splunk/\&quot; class\u003d\&quot;btn\&quot;\u003e💻 View Splunk Configurations\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c!-- Contact Section --\u003e \u003csection style\u003d\&quot;text-align: center; margin-top: 4rem;\&quot;\u003e \u003ch2\u003e📩 Connect With Me\u003c/h2\u003e \u003cp\u003eLooking for a dedicated Security Analyst? Let&#39;s talk!\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEmail:\u003c/strong\u003e kofiagyei79@gmail.com\u003c/p\u003e \u003ca href\u003d\&quot;https://github.com\&quot; class\u003d\&quot;btn\&quot;\u003eGitHub Profile\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/section\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cfooter\u003e \u0026copy; 2026 Kofi Agyei Portfolio. Built with HTML5 \u0026 CSS3. \u003c/footer\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\u003c!DOCTYPE html\u003e\u003chtml lang\u003d\&quot;en\&qu