s Security Engineer\u003c/p\u003e \u003c/header\u003e \u003cdiv class\u003d\&quot;container\&quot;\u003e \u003c!-- Skills Section --\u003e \u003csection\u003e \u003ch2\u003e🛠️ Technical Security Skills \u0026 Tools\u003c/h2\u003e \u003cul class\u003d\&quot;skills-list\&quot;\u003e \u003cli\u003e🟢 Network Scanning: \u003cstrong\u003eNmap\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e🟢 Exploitation: \u003cstrong\u003eMetasploit\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e🟢 Traffic Analysis: \u003cstrong\u003eWireshark\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e🟢 SIEM \u0026 Analytics: \u003cstrong\u003eSplunk\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e🟢 Boundary Routing: \u003cstrong\u003epfSense / VPN\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e🟢 Testing: \u003cstrong\u003eBlack Box Testing\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e \u003c/ul\u003e \u003c/section\u003e \u003chr style\u003d\&quot;border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); margin: 3rem 0;\&quot;\u003e \u003c!-- Projects Section --\u003e \u003ch2\u003e🚀 Cyber Range Portfolio Projects\u003c/h2\u003e \u003c!-- Project 1 --\u003e \u003cdiv class\u003d\&quot;project-card\&quot;\u003e \u003ch3\u003eProject 1: Black Box Hacking Simulation (Capstone)\u003c/h3\u003e \u003cp\u003eSimulated a real-world defensive audit on a blind target environment. Researched hidden attack surfaces, ran stealth service tracking controls, exploited security gaps safely, and structured executive documentation briefs.\u003c/p\u003e \u003ch4\u003eCore Phases Execution:\u003c/h4\u003e \u003cul\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReconnaissance \u0026 Scanning:\u003c/strong\u003e Used Nmap for passive asset mapping and service fingerprinting.\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePacket Analysis:\u003c/strong\u003e Tracked communication layers using Wireshark to locate system vulnerabilities.\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExploitation Sequence:\u003c/strong\u003e Used Metasploit Framework vectors to achieve root authorization footprints.\u003c/li\u003e \u003c/ul\u003e \u003cimg class\u003d\&quot;project-image\&quot; src\u003d\&quot;black-box-hacking.png\&quot; alt\u003d\&quot;Black Box Hacking Lab Screen\&quot;\u003e \u003ca href\u003d\&quot;./Presentation1Black%20Box%20system%20testing.pptx\&quot; class\u003d\&quot;btn\&quot;\u003e📂 Download Presentation\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c!-- Project 2 --\u003e \u003cdiv class\u003d\&quot;project-card\&quot;\u003e \u003ch3\u003eProject 2: Enterprise Hybrid Lab \u0026 Splunk SIEM Engineering\u003c/h3\u003e \u003cp\u003eDesigned a multi-site network lab within EVE-NG to evaluate zero-trust network layout boundaries. Simulated live Red Team penetration routing paths over an encrypted IPsec VPN tunnel while aggregating enterprise telemetry back to a central Splunk platform.\u003c/p\u003e \u003ch4\u003eCore Phases Execution:\u003c/h4\u003e \u003cul\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNetwork Isolation:\u003c/strong\u003e Programmed pfSense firewalls to contain lateral host movement.\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOffensive Auditing:\u003c/strong\u003e Ran custom vulnerability sequences against target systems and corporate web elements.\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDetection Engineering:\u003c/strong\u003e Engineered specialized Splunk Processing Language (SPL) rules to trigger immediate alerts on live attacks.\u003c/li\u003e \u003c/ul\u003e \u003cimg class\u003d\&quot;project-image\&quot; src\u003d\&quot;network-topology.png\&quot; alt\u003d\&quot;EVE-NG Network Topology Map\&quot;\u003e \u003ca href\u003d\&quot;./defensive-blue-team/splunk/\&quot; class\u003d\&quot;btn\&quot;\u003e💻 View Splunk Configurations\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c!-- Contact Section --\u003e \u003csection style\u003d\&quot;text-align: center; margin-top: 4rem;\&quot;\u003e \u003ch2\u003e📩 Connect With Me\u003c/h2\u003e \u003cp\u003eLooking for a dedicated Security Analyst? Let&#39;s talk!\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEmail:\u003c/strong\u003e kofiagyei79@gmail.com\u003c/p\u003e \u003ca href\u003d\&quot;https://github.com\&quot; class\u003d\&quot;btn\&quot;\u003eGitHub Profile\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/section\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cfooter\u003e \u0026copy; 2026 Kofi Agyei Portfolio. Built with HTML5 \u0026 CSS3. \u003c/footer\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\u003c!DOCTYPE html\u003e\u003chtml lang\u003d\&quot;en\&quot;\u003e\u003chead\u003e \u003cmeta charset\u003d\&quot;UTF-8\&quot;\u003e \u003cmeta name\u003d\&quot;viewport\&quot; content\u003d\&quot;width\u003ddevice-width, initial-scale\u003d1.0\&quot;\u003e \u003ctitle\u003eKofi Agyei | Cybersecurity Portfolio\u003c/title\u003e \u003cstyle\u003e :root { --bg-color: #0d1117; --text-color: #c9d1d9; --accent-color: #58a6ff; --card-bg: #161b22; --border-color: #30363d; } body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Segoe UI\&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: var(--bg-color); color: var(--text-color); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; padding: 0; } header { background-color: var(--card-bg); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 2rem 1rem; text-align: center; } h1 { color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; } h2, h3 { color: var(--accent-color); } .container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1rem; } .skills-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; padding: 0; list-style: none; } .skills-list li { background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: 6px; text-align: center; } .project-card { background-color: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 8px; padding: 2rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; } .project-image { max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); margin: 1.5rem 0; di&quot;]]--></div><div data-subtree="aimc" decode-data-ved="1" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="v48bt#VKyOOd" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="MnlGHc_1zv" data-processed="true"><div jsuid="MnlGHc_1zs" class="Zkbeff" dir="ltr" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;MnlGHc_1zs|npT2md" jscontroller="nfCumd#tcxHxb" data-sfc-root="ep" data-wiz-uids="MnlGHc_1zt" data-ctx-provider="[[[&quot;b9Q7he&quot;,&quot;[{\&quot;s\&quot;:3,\&quot;i\&quot;:\&quot;MnlGHc_1zs/LL5gb\&quot;}]&quot;],[&quot;dMtGDc&quot;,&quot;[false]&quot;]]]" data-ved="2ahUKEwiE4ueE7M2WAxUnEmIAHe7iEZ4Q2O0OegkIAggBCJcBEAw" data-hveid="CAIIAQiXARAM" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><h3 class="MheKwc" jsaction="" data-wiz-attrbind="class=MnlGHc_202/ggNWmb" jscontroller="j7xZu#zJD6ff" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="MnlGHc_202" data-processed="true">AI Mode reply for 1 tab and &lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;&lt;html lang="en"&gt;&lt;head&gt;    &lt;meta charset="UTF-8"&gt;    &lt;meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"&gt;    &lt;title&gt;Kofi Agyei | Cybersecurity Portfolio&lt;/title&gt;    &lt;style&gt;        :root {            --bg-color: #0d1117;            --text-color: #c9d1d9;            --accent-color: #58a6ff;            --card-bg: #161b22;            --border-color: #30363d;        }        body {            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;            background-color: var(--bg-color);            color: var(--text-color);            line-height: 1.6;            margin: 0;            padding: 0;        }        header {            background-color: var(--card-bg);            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);            padding: 2rem 1rem;            text-align: center;        }        h1 { color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }        h2, h3 { color: var(--accent-color); }        .container {            max-width: 900px;            margin: 0 auto;            padding: 2rem 1rem;        }        .skills-list {            display: grid;            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));            gap: 1rem;            padding: 0;            list-style: none;        }        .skills-list li {            background: var(--card-bg);            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);            padding: 0.75rem;            border-radius: 6px;            text-align: center;        }        .project-card {            background-color: var(--card-bg);            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);            border-radius: 8px;            padding: 2rem;            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;        }        .project-image {            max-width: 100%;            height: auto;            border-radius: 6px;            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);            margin: 1.5rem 0;            display: block;        }        .btn {            display: inline-block;            background-color: #21262d;            color: var(--accent-color);            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;            border-radius: 6px;            text-decoration: none;            font-weight: 600;            margin-right: 0.5rem;            margin-top: 0.5rem;        }        .btn:hover {            background-color: #30363d;            border-color: #8b949e;        }        footer {            text-align: center;            padding: 2rem;            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);            font-size: 0.9rem;        }    &lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body&gt;    &lt;header&gt;        &lt;h1&gt;Kofi Agyei&lt;/h1&gt;        &lt;p&gt;Cybersecurity Analyst &amp; Systems Security Engineer&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;/header&gt;    &lt;div class="container"&gt;                &lt;!-- Skills Section --&gt;        &lt;section&gt;            &lt;h2&gt;🛠️ Technical Security Skills &amp; Tools&lt;/h2&gt;            &lt;ul class="skills-list"&gt;                &lt;li&gt;🟢 Network Scanning: &lt;strong&gt;Nmap&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;                &lt;li&gt;🟢 Exploitation: &lt;strong&gt;Metasploit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;                &lt;li&gt;🟢 Traffic Analysis: &lt;strong&gt;Wireshark&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;                &lt;li&gt;🟢 SIEM &amp; Analytics: &lt;strong&gt;Splunk&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;                &lt;li&gt;🟢 Boundary Routing: &lt;strong&gt;pfSense / VPN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;                &lt;li&gt;🟢 Testing: &lt;strong&gt;Black Box Testing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;            &lt;/ul&gt;        &lt;/section&gt;        &lt;hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); margin: 3rem 0;"&gt;        &lt;!-- Projects Section --&gt;        &lt;h2&gt;🚀 Cyber Range Portfolio Projects&lt;/h2&gt;        &lt;!-- Project 1 --&gt;        &lt;div class="project-card"&gt;            &lt;h3&gt;Project 1: Black Box Hacking Simulation (Capstone)&lt;/h3&gt;            &lt;p&gt;Simulated a real-world defensive audit on a blind target environment. Researched hidden attack surfaces, ran stealth service tracking controls, exploited security gaps safely, and structured executive documentation briefs.&lt;/p&gt;                        &lt;h4&gt;Core Phases Execution:&lt;/h4&gt;            &lt;ul&gt;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reconnaissance &amp; Scanning:&lt;/strong&gt; Used Nmap for passive asset mapping and service fingerprinting.&lt;/li&gt;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Packet Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Tracked communication layers using Wireshark to locate system vulnerabilities.&lt;/li&gt;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exploitation Sequence:&lt;/strong&gt; Used Metasploit Framework vectors to achieve root authorization footprints.&lt;/li&gt;            &lt;/ul&gt;                        &lt;img class="project-image" src="black-box-hacking.png" alt="Black Box Hacking Lab Screen"&gt;            &lt;a href="./Presentation1Black%20Box%20system%20testing.pptx" class="btn"&gt;📂 Download Presentation&lt;/a&gt;        &lt;/div&gt;        &lt;!-- Project 2 --&gt;        &lt;div class="project-card"&gt;            &lt;h3&gt;Project 2: Enterprise Hybrid Lab &amp; Splunk SIEM Engineering&lt;/h3&gt;            &lt;p&gt;Designed a multi-site network lab within EVE-NG to evaluate zero-trust network layout boundaries. Simulated live Red Team penetration routing paths over an encrypted IPsec VPN tunnel while aggregating enterprise telemetry back to a central Splunk platform.&lt;/p&gt;                        &lt;h4&gt;Core Phases Execution:&lt;/h4&gt;            &lt;ul&gt;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Network Isolation:&lt;/strong&gt; Programmed pfSense firewalls to contain lateral host movement.&lt;/li&gt;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Offensive Auditing:&lt;/strong&gt; Ran custom vulnerability sequences against target systems and corporate web elements.&lt;/li&gt;                &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detection Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineered specialized Splunk Processing Language (SPL) rules to trigger immediate alerts on live attacks.&lt;/li&gt;            &lt;/ul&gt;                        &lt;img class="project-image" src="network-topology.png" alt="EVE-NG Network Topology Map"&gt;            &lt;a href="./defensive-blue-team/splunk/" class="btn"&gt;💻 View Splunk Configurations&lt;/a&gt;        &lt;/div&gt;        &lt;!-- Contact Section --&gt;        &lt;section style="text-align: center; margin-top: 4rem;"&gt;            &lt;h2&gt;📩 Connect With Me&lt;/h2&gt;            &lt;p&gt;Looking for a dedicated Security Analyst? Let's talk!&lt;/p&gt;            &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Email:&lt;/strong&gt; kofiagyei79@gmail.com&lt;/p&gt;            &lt;a href="https://github.com" class="btn"&gt;GitHub Profile&lt;/a&gt;        &lt;/section&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;footer&gt;        &amp;copy; 2026 Kofi Agyei Portfolio. Built with HTML5 &amp; CSS3.    &lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;&lt;html lang="en"&gt;&lt;head&gt;    &lt;meta charset="UTF-8"&gt;    &lt;meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"&gt;    &lt;title&gt;Kofi Agyei | Cybersecurity Portfolio&lt;/title&gt;    &lt;style&gt;        :root {            --bg-color: #0d1117;            --text-color: #c9d1d9;            --accent-color: #58a6ff;            --card-bg: #161b22;            --border-color: #30363d;        }        body {            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;            background-color: var(--bg-color);            color: var(--text-color);            line-height: 1.6;            margin: 0;            padding: 0;        }        header {            background-color: var(--card-bg);            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);            padding: 2rem 1rem;            text-align: center;        }        h1 { color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }        h2, h3 { color: var(--accent-color); }        .container {            max-width: 900px;            margin: 0 auto;            padding: 2rem 1rem;        }        .skills-list {            display: grid;            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));            gap: 1rem;            padding: 0;            list-style: none;        }        .skills-list li {            background: var(--card-bg);            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);            padding: 0.75rem;            border-radius: 6px;            text-align: center;        }        .project-card {            background-color: var(--card-bg);            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);            border-radius: 8px;            padding: 2rem;            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;        }        .project-image {            max-width: 100%;            height: auto;            border-radius: 6px;            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);            margin: 1.5rem 0;            di<!--TgQPHdMnlGHc_1zs/We76zc|||[{&quot;s&quot;:false,&quot;i&quot;:&quot;MnlGHc_1zs/We76zc&quot;}]--></h3><div class="pWvJNd" jsaction="" jscontroller="zp3Dsd#fP0RJ" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="MnlGHc_20q" data-processed="true"><div jsname="s7