t;&quot;,0,0,null,1,&quot;&quot;,[&quot;&quot;,&quot;&quot;],null,[],null,[[[[&quot;Applying Personal Intelligence&quot;]],null,302434]]]]--></div><div style="display:none;" jsuid="OgmVWc_n" data-complete="true" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;OgmVWc_n|npT2md" jscontroller="LmU7De#TzOkP" data-sfc-root="ep" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[[null,null,null,&quot;&quot;,0,5,null,0,&quot;&quot;,[&quot;&quot;,&quot;&quot;],null,[]]]--></div></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div jsuid="OgmVWc_7" dir="ltr" data-container-id="main-col" data-xid="VpUvz" jsname="KFl8ub" class="mZJni Dn7Fzd" jsaction="cC6SSe:&amp;OgmVWc_7|mNzCb;" jscontroller="Aoijq#INwBm" data-sfc-root="ep" data-ctx-provider="[[[&quot;dMtGDc&quot;,&quot;[false]&quot;]]]" data-ved="2ahUKEwi8jImh8M2WAxUqEmIAHevKLwYQ3KYQegYIAQgCEAE" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><div style="display: contents" data-container-id="7" data-processed="true"><div class="n6owBd awi2gc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="TDBkbc#Ml18Xb" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="OgmVWc_s" data-hveid="CAEIChAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true">The reason your architectural layout is missing is that your website code is currently only set up to show <strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="OgmVWc_t" data-complete="true" data-processed="true">one image per project<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>.<span jsuid="OgmVWc_u" class="DHPVt Wg1cdb notranslate" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;OgmVWc_u|npT2md" jscontroller="XqmSxe#JjQTXe" data-sfc-root="ep" data-wiz-uids="OgmVWc_v,OgmVWc_w,OgmVWc_x" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><span class="NMq1me" data-animation-atomic="" jsaction="click:&amp;OgmVWc_u|ZUljYd" data-sae="" style=""><span aria-hidden="true">&nbsp;</span><!--qkimaf OgmVWc_u/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb OgmVWc_u/HugV6--><button jsuid="OgmVWc_w" tabindex="0" data-amic="true" data-icl-uuid="ca052f19-05a5-405a-9832-a026c3fd2ee8" aria-label="Related results" class="vDOt8c" jsaction="click:&amp;OgmVWc_u|CXhG2e;mouseenter:&amp;OgmVWc_u|wndyDd;mouseleave:&amp;OgmVWc_u|yrMC6" data-ved="2ahUKEwi8jImh8M2WAxUqEmIAHevKLwYQye0OegYIAQgKEAE" data-hveid="CAEIChAB"><span class="pxxQye T6UJT"><div class="a14YJe" jsaction="" jscontroller="sRLmTc#WhfBh" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="OgmVWc_y" data-complete="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" height="12px" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="12px"><path d="M440-280H280q-83 0-141.5-58.5T80-480q0-83 58.5-141.5T280-680h160v80H280q-50 0-85 35t-35 85q0 50 35 85t85 35h160v80ZM320-440v-80h320v80H320Zm200 160v-80h160q50 0 85-35t35-85q0-50-35-85t-85-35H520v-80h160q83 0 141.5 58.5T880-480q0 83-58.5 141.5T680-280H520Z"></path></svg><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div></span><div jsuid="OgmVWc_v" style="display: none;" data-ved="2ahUKEwi8jImh8M2WAxUqEmIAHevKLwYQlZkRegYIAQgKEAI"></div></button></span><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;ca052f19-05a5-405a-9832-a026c3fd2ee8&quot;,null,null,0,&quot;&quot;,&quot;&quot;,0,null,null,null,null,0,null,0]]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div class="n6owBd awi2gc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="TDBkbc#Ml18Xb" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="OgmVWc_z" data-hveid="CAEICxAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true">In your <code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="OgmVWc_10" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="">index.html<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code> file, we pointed Project 1 to the black-box image (<code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="OgmVWc_11" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="">image_d9a34027.png<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code>) and Project 2 to the EVE-NG image (<code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="OgmVWc_12" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="">image_e4e52062.png<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code>). Because of this layout structure, your second file (the architectural format topology) isn't being called anywhere in the code.<span jsuid="OgmVWc_13" class="DHPVt Wg1cdb notranslate" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;OgmVWc_13|npT2md" jscontroller="XqmSxe#JjQTXe" data-sfc-root="ep" data-wiz-uids="OgmVWc_14,OgmVWc_15,OgmVWc_16" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><span class="NMq1me" data-animation-atomic="" jsaction="click:&amp;OgmVWc_13|ZUljYd" data-sae="" style=""><span aria-hidden="true">&nbsp;</span><!--qkimaf OgmVWc_13/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb OgmVWc_13/HugV6--><button jsuid="OgmVWc_15" tabindex="0" data-amic="true" data-icl-uuid="518ff220-c5a6-4155-8ad7-83b08a43ad13" aria-label="Related results" class="vDOt8c" jsaction="click:&amp;OgmVWc_13|CXhG2e;mouseenter:&amp;OgmVWc_13|wndyDd;mouseleave:&amp;OgmVWc_13|yrMC6" data-ved="2ahUKEwi8jImh8M2WAxUqEmIAHevKLwYQye0OegYIAQgLEAE" data-hveid="CAEICxAB"><span class="pxxQye T6UJT"><div class="a14YJe" jsaction="" jscontroller="sRLmTc#WhfBh" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="OgmVWc_17" data-complete="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" height="12px" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="12px"><path d="M440-280H280q-83 0-141.5-58.5T80-480q0-83 58.5-141.5T280-680h160v80H280q-50 0-85 35t-35 85q0 50 35 85t85 35h160v80ZM320-440v-80h320v80H320Zm200 160v-80h160q50 0 85-35t35-85q0-50-35-85t-85-35H520v-80h160q83 0 141.5 58.5T880-480q0 83-58.5 141.5T680-280H520Z"></path></svg><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div></span><div jsuid="OgmVWc_14" style="display: none;" data-ved="2ahUKEwi8jImh8M2WAxUqEmIAHevKLwYQlZkRegYIAQgLEAI"></div></button></span><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;518ff220-c5a6-4155-8ad7-83b08a43ad13&quot;,null,null,0,&quot;&quot;,&quot;&quot;,0,null,null,null,null,0,null,0]]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div class="n6owBd awi2gc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="TDBkbc#Ml18Xb" data-sfc-root="ep" jsuid="OgmVWc_18" data-hveid="CAEIDBAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true">To fix this and display <strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS