            &lt;</span><span class="mexSqb">h3</span><span class="undefined">&gt;Project </span><span class="tnfcCf">1</span><span class="undefined">: Black Box Hacking Simulation (Capstone)&lt;/</span><span class="mexSqb">h3</span><span class="undefined">&gt;
            &lt;</span><span class="mexSqb">p</span><span class="undefined">&gt;Simulated a real-world defensive audit on a blind target environment. Researched hidden attack surfaces, ran stealth service tracking controls, exploited security gaps safely, and structured executive documentation briefs.&lt;/</span><span class="mexSqb">p</span><span class="undefined">&gt;
            
            &lt;</span><span class="mexSqb">h4</span><span class="undefined">&gt;Core Phases Execution:&lt;/</span><span class="mexSqb">h4</span><span class="undefined">&gt;
